<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns starts 4 cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns starts 4 cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of Sinter Metals Inc and Donnelly Corp as buy, Excel Industries Inc as attractive and Walbro Corp as neutral, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.  </p>
<p>-- Sinter ended Monday at 23-1/8, Donnelly rose 3/8 to 19-7/8, Excel rose 1/8 to 15-1/8 and Walbro slipped 1/8 to 20-1/8.</p>
</text>
